  "body": "The Grand Dame of Church Street, dating back to 1873, stands proudly on a generous 819sqm parcel of land, brimming with character, charm and timeless appeal. Rich in history and offering enormous potential, this much-loved home is ready for someone with vision, care and imagination to restore her to her former glory. After 27 exceptionally happy years and the paint drying on her new home, our current owner has made the heartfelt decision to move on, presenting a rare and exciting opportunity for a new family to make this remarkable property their own and become the next proud custodians of a truly special piece of Church Street history.\r\n\r\nWith generous proportions and a traditional family-friendly layout, this character-filled home offers wonderful space and versatility. The ground floor features a grand formal lounge, elegant dining room, separate office or second living area, spacious kitchen and separate laundry.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the generous master suite captures spectacular views across the harbour to North Head and Rangitoto, complete with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. Three further bedrooms, a family bathroom and a spacious central landing with its own breathtaking outlook complete the upper level.\r\n\r\nOutside, the beautifully established garden features mature fruit trees, charming old-fashioned roses and productive vegetable beds, creating a wonderful sense of space and seasonal enjoyment. A swimming pool provides the perfect setting for summer fun and entertaining, while the separate garage with bathroom and studio above offers excellent additional flexibility and outstanding views.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally appealing, with Mount Victoria on your doorstep, newly refurbished tennis courts nearby, Cheltenham Beach an easy stroll away and Devonport village just over the hill, offering cafés, boutique shopping and the iconic Victoria Cinema.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a home of such character, scale and position. Our owner is ready for her next chapter and looks forward to welcoming the next family to call this special property home.\r\n\r\nAuction 17th December at 12.00pm (Unless Sold Prior) In Rooms, 128 Hurstmere Road, Takapuna\r\nTo download property files please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/18ZZ",
